# TODO: Translation updated at 2026-11-28 07:05

# game/case07.rpy:60
translate schinese press_alice_1_56e5a90f:

    # you "How did she get in?"
    you "她是怎么进来的？"

# game/case07.rpy:61
translate schinese press_alice_1_9663285e:

    # alice "Through the window. She has never once used a door."
    alice "从窗户。她一次都没走过门。"

# game/case07.rpy:63
translate schinese press_alice_1_dc9e6e55:

    # eiki "A pattern is emerging."
    eiki "规律渐渐浮现了。"

# game/case07.rpy:67
translate schinese press_alice_2_caec51e3:

    # you "What was the comment, exactly?"
    you "她到底说了什么？"

# game/case07.rpy:69
translate schinese press_alice_2_9641f26c:

    # alice "Something rude. The details don't matter."
    alice "很无礼的话。细节不重要。"

# game/case07.rpy:71
translate schinese press_alice_2_e220c05f:

    # eiki "The details are the entire case."
    eiki "细节就是整个案子。"

# game/case07.rpy:75
translate schinese press_alice_3_a5c3768a:

    # you "Defended it from what?"
    you "捍卫它免受什么？"

# game/case07.rpy:76
translate schinese press_alice_3_a465442d:

    # alice "From her insult, obviously. Put this in my testimony. Word for word."
    alice "当然是她的侮辱。把这句加进我的证词。一字不差。"

# game/case07.rpy:80
translate schinese press_alice_4_29dfe6a2:

    # you "Are those her exact words? \"Worthless junk\"?"
    you "这是她的原话吗？“一文不值的破烂”？"

# game/case07.rpy:82
translate schinese press_alice_4_2a78c31f:

    # alice "Close enough. It's what she meant. I could tell by her face."
    alice "差不多。她就是这个意思。看她的脸就知道。"

# game/case07.rpy:84
translate schinese press_alice_4_adbc380a:

    # eiki "A face is not a quote."
    eiki "表情不是原话。"

# game/case07.rpy:95
translate schinese case7_3af4f096:

    # eiki "Order. The Higan Court of Logic is in session."
    eiki "肃静。彼岸逻辑法庭现在开庭。"

# game/case07.rpy:97
translate schinese case7_b506956e:

    # eiki "Komachi. The defendant?"
    eiki "小町。被告呢？"

# game/case07.rpy:98
translate schinese case7_7452aaf8:

    # komachi "Here, boss. She brought a lawyer."
    komachi "带来了，四季大人。她还带了律师。"

# game/case07.rpy:99
translate schinese case7_044329bf:

    # eiki "This court does not allow—"
    eiki "本庭不允许——"

# game/case07.rpy:100
translate schinese case7_fd065541:

    # komachi "It's a doll, boss. It's very quiet."
    komachi "是个人偶，四季大人。很安静的。"

# game/case07.rpy:103
translate schinese case7_27484148:

    # alice "Alice Margatroid, puppeteer of the Forest of Magic. I'll be brief. I had every right."
    alice "魔法森林的人偶师，爱丽丝·玛格特罗依德。长话短说。我完全有权这么做。"

# game/case07.rpy:106
translate schinese case7_6f6eb84d:

    # eiki "The charge: tying Kirisame Marisa to a tree with doll string. For six hours."
    eiki "罪名：用人偶丝线把雾雨魔理沙绑在树上。绑了六个小时。"

# game/case07.rpy:110
translate schinese case7_a6f83d57:

    # alice "Seven. She wriggled."
    alice "七个小时。她一直在扭。"

# game/case07.rpy:114
translate schinese case7_d515cc3d:

    # eiki "Junior Judge. Before you weigh an argument, make sure it is the one actually made."
    eiki "见习法官。衡量一个论点之前，先确认那是对方真正说过的。"

# game/case07.rpy:115
translate schinese case7_968c1297:

    # eiki "Anyone can knock down a scarecrow. Check that it isn't one."
    eiki "稻草人谁都推得倒。先确认它不是稻草人。"

# game/case07.rpy:131
translate schinese case7_dd8bf47c:

    # alice_t "Yesterday Marisa came to my house. Uninvited, as always."
    alice_t "昨天魔理沙来我家了。照例不请自来。"

# game/case07.rpy:132
translate schinese case7_fde9563a:

    # alice_t "She looked at my newest doll and made a comment about it."
    alice_t "她看了我最新的人偶，评论了一句。"

# game/case07.rpy:133
translate schinese case7_373ff126:

    # alice_t "So I defended my life's work. Anyone would have."
    alice_t "所以我捍卫了我毕生的心血。换谁都会这么做。"

# game/case07.rpy:137
translate schinese case7_d3c9298c:

    # eiki "The floor is yours, Junior Judge. Mind the strings."
    eiki "交给你了，见习法官。小心丝线。"

# game/case07.rpy:151
translate schinese case7_cross_91432a3d:

    # eiki "Again. And Komachi, give the lawyer back."
    eiki "再来一次。还有小町，把律师还回去。"

# game/case07.rpy:162
translate schinese case7_breakthrough_9ee5cbab:

    # you "Marisa never called your dolls junk. She said they're really good, and take forever to make."
    you "魔理沙从没说你的人偶是破烂。她说的是做得很好，只是做起来很慢。"

# game/case07.rpy:163
translate schinese case7_breakthrough_6185b8ed:

    # you "You argued against the insult you imagined, not the comment she made."
    you "你反驳的是你想象出来的侮辱，而不是她说的话。"

# game/case07.rpy:166
translate schinese case7_breakthrough_2895e2c8:

    # alice "...She said they were really good? In the newspaper? In print?"
    alice "……她说做得很好？在报纸上？白纸黑字？"

# game/case07.rpy:170
translate schinese case7_breakthrough_cf12b169:

    # eiki "A straw man. Rebuild someone's words into something weaker, then knock that down instead."
    eiki "稻草人谬误。把别人的话改造成更弱的样子，再去推倒它。"

# game/case07.rpy:171
translate schinese case7_breakthrough_a6ab13e4:

    # eiki "Answer what was said. Not what you wish had been said."
    eiki "回应对方说过的话。而不是你希望对方说过的话。"

# game/case07.rpy:178
translate schinese case7_breakthrough_bfc29046:

    # eiki "Defendant Alice Margatroid. This court finds you..."
    eiki "被告爱丽丝·玛格特罗依德。本庭判决你……"

# game/case07.rpy:189
translate schinese case7_breakthrough_ecd26d99:

    # eiki "Sentence: untie Marisa. Then apologise. In person."
    eiki "判决：给魔理沙松绑。然后当面道歉。"

# game/case07.rpy:192
translate schinese case7_breakthrough_8240e028:

    # alice "...She's still tied to the tree?"
    alice "……她还被绑在树上？"

# game/case07.rpy:195
translate schinese case7_breakthrough_b0bb663a:

    # komachi "Since yesterday, boss. She asked me to bring snacks."
    komachi "从昨天起就绑着了，四季大人。她托我带点零食。"

# game/case07.rpy:196
translate schinese case7_breakthrough_ce35d871:

    # eiki "Then bring snacks. And escort the defendant to the tree. Bailiff."
    eiki "那就带零食去。顺便把被告押到树那边。法警。"

# game/case07.rpy:197
translate schinese case7_breakthrough_ce8461be:

    # komachi "On it, boss."
    komachi "这就去，四季大人。"

# game/case07.rpy:209
translate schinese case7_breakthrough_1d8bb793:

    # eiki "Court is adjourned. Someone take that magician a sandwich."
    eiki "退庭。谁给那位魔法使送个三明治。"

# game/case07.rpy:210
translate schinese case7_breakthrough_3948a694:

    # komachi "Already packed two, boss. One's for me."
    komachi "已经包好两个了，四季大人。一个是我的。"

translate schinese strings:

    # game/case07.rpy:9
    old "Alice's Newest Doll"
    new "爱丽丝的最新人偶"

    # game/case07.rpy:9
    old "Hand-stitched over three months. Beautiful. One button still missing."
    new "手工缝制三个月。很美。还差一颗纽扣。"

    # game/case07.rpy:11
    old "Doll String"
    new "人偶丝线"

    # game/case07.rpy:11
    old "Six metres, enchanted. Found knotted around a tree, very, very tightly."
    new "六米，附有魔法。被发现紧紧、紧紧地缠在一棵树上。"

    # game/case07.rpy:13
    old "Bunbunmaru Clipping"
    new "文文。新闻剪报"

    # game/case07.rpy:13
    old "Yesterday's quote: \"Alice's dolls are really good. They just take forever to make.\" —M. Kirisame"
    new "昨日原话：“爱丽丝的人偶真的很棒。就是做起来太慢了。”——雾雨魔理沙"

    # game/case07.rpy:16
    old "The Puppeteer's Pride"
    new "人偶师的骄傲"

    # game/case07.rpy:16
    old "Yesterday Marisa came to my house. Uninvited, as always."
    new "昨天魔理沙来我家了。照例不请自来。"

    # game/case07.rpy:16
    old "Uninvited, yes. Illogical, no. Keep looking."
    new "不请自来，没错。不合逻辑，没有。继续找。"

    # game/case07.rpy:16
    old "She looked at my newest doll and made a comment about it."
    new "她看了我最新的人偶，评论了一句。"

    # game/case07.rpy:16
    old "A comment is a fact. What she makes of it is the question."
    new "评论是事实。问题在于她怎么理解它。"

    # game/case07.rpy:16
    old "So I defended my life's work. Anyone would have."
    new "所以我捍卫了我毕生的心血。换谁都会这么做。"

    # game/case07.rpy:16
    old "Defended it from what, exactly? Press her first."
    new "到底是捍卫它免受什么？先追问她。"

    # game/case07.rpy:16
    old "She called my dolls worthless junk and said I should quit. So she deserved the string."
    new "她说我的人偶是一文不值的破烂，还叫我别做了。所以她活该被绑。"

    # game/case07.rpy:16
    old "Close cousin. But she isn't attacking Marisa's character. She's attacking words Marisa never said."
    new "近亲。但她攻击的不是魔理沙的人品，而是魔理沙从没说过的话。"

    # game/case07.rpy:16
    old "She isn't saying \"you do it too.\" She's rewriting what Marisa said."
    new "她没说“你也一样”。她是在改写魔理沙说的话。"

    # game/case07.rpy:16
    old "No chain of disasters predicted. Just a quote, quietly rewritten."
    new "没有预言灾难连锁。只是一句话被悄悄改写了。"

    # game/case07.rpy:16
    old "Order isn't the issue. The issue is whether Marisa said that at all."
    new "问题不在先后顺序，而在魔理沙到底有没有说过。"

    # game/case07.rpy:16
    old "She isn't generalising from one example. She's replacing the real comment with a crueller one."
    new "她不是从一个例子推而广之。她是把真实的评论换成了更刻薄的版本。"

    # game/case07.rpy:16
    old "No either-or. Just a comment that grew teeth between Marisa's mouth and this court."
    new "没有非此即彼。只是一句评论从魔理沙嘴里到本庭的路上长出了獠牙。"

    # game/case07.rpy:16
    old "No famous name cited. Just a quote, misquoted."
    new "没有搬出大人物。只是一句话被引错了。"

    # game/case07.rpy:16
    old "Her reason isn't her conclusion. Her reason is a quote nobody said."
    new "她的理由不是她的结论。她的理由是一句谁都没说过的话。"

    # game/case07.rpy:16
    old "That doesn't tell us what Marisa actually said. Find her real words."
    new "这说明不了魔理沙到底说了什么。找出她的原话。"

